From 80238d6f006078ececb954c6525dffd89e4e55fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnav <123669753+arnofrxdd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 20:54:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tools): support inline URL path parameters for custom
 HTTP tools (#617)

* feat: extract URL path parameter substitution

* style: apply ruff format and lint to changed files

* fix: address audit feedback for url path params

* fix(tools): address bot review comments regarding security and ui

* fix(tools): test ui lowercase method preview and format code

* fix(ui): add empty line after import to satisfy linter

* fix: simplify HTTP URL template rendering

---------

Co-authored-by: Abhishek Kumar <abhishek@a6k.me>
